          "source": "Select the subdomain and domain that match your Zoho account:\n- **Sub Domain**: 'zoho' (standard) or 'zohocloud' (cloud accounts)\n- **Domain**: Based on your data center region (.com for US/Global, .eu for Europe, .in for India, .com.au for Australia, .ca for Canada, .sa for Saudi Arabia, .jp for Japan)",
